Sounds like you're doing lots of work on this dataset. The various abundance comparisons you present lack measures of precision, so it is difficult to know if the percentages you cite are meaningful. Difficult to provide advice of relevance to the rest of the audience without having a deeper dive into your analyses.

Would you want to share code and data off-list and we can come back to the list with any revelations we might discover that may be of general interest.
